WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:07.000
An uncut browser rehearsal: the Knight revisits Mara after recovering the first clue.

00:07.000 --> 00:18.000
The Knight walks from Highcross into the open-PvP Briar March. The arch fades to keep the road visible.

00:18.000 --> 00:27.000
Steel cuts and hound impacts. The server resolves health, cast timing and the creature reward.

00:27.000 --> 00:45.000
The route crosses the bridge and a second hound encounter. Field tools send ordinary movement and attack commands.

00:45.000 --> 00:54.000
The weathered epitaph describes the missing thirteenth hour. This character has already completed this clue.

00:54.000 --> 01:15.000
The Knight returns through the gate to safe Highcross. Real-time canvas, actual HUD and synthesized game sound; no generated video.
